    {
      "block_id": "2605.06070_p9_b32",
      "text": "Effect of Scaling Coefficient \u03b3\nTo align\nthe scale when incorporating QD, we intro-\nduce a scaling coefficient \u03b3. We perform\na grid search over \u03b3, as shown in Figure 7.\nThe final performance is relatively insensi-\ntive to the choice of \u03b3, and achieves the best\noverall result at 1 \u00d7 10\u22123. Consequently,\nfor simplicity and general applicability, we\nfix this parameter to 1 \u00d7 10\u22123 across all\nexperiments.\n",
      "bbox": [
        107.69,
        468.1,
        277.98,
        576.48
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
